      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/agtfEnOnqyYtk1eapMhy-WKjhjw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-216895-drawn-butter-VAT-step-01-d6f4647cc4644466b465c0042dbc3653.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216895/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in the top of a double boiler over barely simmering water, 5 to 7 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dFEjsBTfBYrCez8CPAvHtTpJFyI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-216895-drawn-butter-VAT-step-02-bd3fa5b2329a495db7bb72aa9aa288ec.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216895/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Set melted butter aside to cool slightly, then skim foam off the top and discard. Allow butter to solidify, 8 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dgLKrubsCP3GhCthvCHbWW0xbrE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-216895-drawn-butter-VAT-step-03-2chilled-da3f55f78221433c9dad3a85a3f062bc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216895/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain off any liquid that is collected at the bottom. Transfer butter to a microwave-safe glass or ceramic bowl and microwave until melted. Pour into individual bowls to serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
